# The image installs its own dependencies for Linux with `npm ci`. Without
# this file `COPY . .` sent the host's node_modules — 87MB, built for macOS —
# into the build context on every build and merged it over the Linux install,
# which is why the image carried both darwin-arm64 and linux-arm64 esbuild.
# It worked because the two happened to coexist, not because it was right.
node_modules
dist
coverage
*.log
